        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="github" value="&lt;b&gt;GitHub&lt;/b&gt; Y-ONE-soft/yone-design-studio-web&lt;br&gt;배포: git pull → fly deploy (원격 빌드)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="420" y="930" width="300" height="55" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="anthropic" value="&lt;b&gt;Anthropic API&lt;/b&gt; (클로드) — Y.OS 와 같은 키&lt;br&gt;PDF 판정 · 작업대 클로드 칸" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="800" y="930" width="300" height="55" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <!-- ───────── 흐름표 · 미결 ───────── -->
        <mxCell id="flows" value="&lt;b&gt;흐름&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; (실선 = 지금 구현됨 · 점선 = 나중 / 배포)&lt;br&gt;① 디자이너 → 스튜디오 → (세션 없음) → yos-design-web/studio?next=… → Auth.js 로그인&lt;br&gt;② design 이 표 발급(signStudioToken) → https://yos-studio.fly.dev/auth/callback?token=…&amp;amp;next= → 세션 쿠키 12h&lt;br&gt;③ 디자이너 → /catalog · /book-studio (세션 쿠키)&lt;br&gt;④ contents/design → GET /api/v1/catalog — 틀 · 디자인 · 미리보기(Blob URL) · version (SERVICE_TOKEN)&lt;br&gt;⑤ contents → POST /api/v1/renders {design, source:{type:&quot;yos&quot;|&quot;data&quot;…}} → 202 job → 폴링 또는 ⑦&lt;br&gt;⑥ studio(sources) → contents GET /api/typeset/data?series=… (YOS_CONTENTS_TOKEN)&lt;br&gt;⑦ studio → contents 웹훅 render.finished · design.changed (x-studio-signature) → revalidateTag&lt;br&gt;⑧ studio → Vercel Blob: PDF private · 미리보기 public → contents 는 pathname 저장, presignUrl 로 열람&lt;br&gt;⑨ contents iframe: POST /api/v1/embed-token → /auth/embed?t= → /book-studio (frame-ancestors = YOS_ORIGINS)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#ffffff;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="670" width="640" height="170" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="decisions" value="&lt;b&gt;원칙&lt;/b&gt; contents = 데이터 주인 · 스튜디오 = 지면 주인 · 복사 대신 API · 디자인 version 은 렌더 기록에 · Y.OS 가 이미 쓰는 것(Fly · Blob · 링크 토큰)만 쓴다&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;미결&lt;/b&gt; 첫 연동 계열(→ data.schema.json) · Blob 토큰(contents 스토어) · 진입 라우트 둘 앱(design 권장) · 상용 서체 서버 라이선스" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fff2cc;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="740" y="812" width="820" height="60" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

